WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
(playful music)

00:00:03.562 --> 00:00:04.930
Hi, I'm Sequoia Holmes.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:07.123
I just took an Ancestry DNA Kit Test,

00:00:07.123 --> 00:00:08.875
and my results were super surprising.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.203
So today I'm going to be making a dish

00:00:10.203 --> 00:00:12.320
that dates back to my earliest ancestors.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.828
Today, I'm going to ease myself into it,

00:00:14.828 --> 00:00:16.376
make something really simple.

00:00:16.376 --> 00:00:19.809
I'm going to make amiwo with
mojo sauce and grilled chicken.

00:00:19.809 --> 00:00:22.041
When I first got my Ancestry DNA results,

00:00:22.041 --> 00:00:25.866
I was really surprised how
specific the results were.

00:00:25.866 --> 00:00:27.870
I was really shocked
to see Benin on there.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.510
I knew nothing about Benin.

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:30.995
So, I was really excited

00:00:30.995 --> 00:00:32.318
and immediately started
researching everything

00:00:32.318 --> 00:00:33.778
that I could find about it.

00:00:33.778 --> 00:00:35.987
I found out it was the
birthplace of voodoo.

00:00:35.987 --> 00:00:37.540
Thought that was really cool.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.446
Also found out that they
have a really vibrant

00:00:39.446 --> 00:00:40.279
food scene.

00:00:40.279 --> 00:00:42.109
I'm a very beginner
cook, so I wanted to go

00:00:42.109 --> 00:00:43.362
easy on myself and choose something that

00:00:43.362 --> 00:00:45.079
wasn't going to be super difficult.

00:00:45.079 --> 00:00:48.468
I chose amiwo, which you
probably have never heard of.

00:00:48.468 --> 00:00:51.367
It's a really simple,
authentic, savory cake.

00:00:51.367 --> 00:00:53.576
I would compare it to polenta.

00:00:53.576 --> 00:00:55.510
You can serve this with fried
chicken, grilled chicken,

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:58.336
sometimes fish. But I
chose grilled chicken

00:00:58.336 --> 00:01:00.232
today because it's easy.

00:01:00.232 --> 00:01:01.805
I grew up eating a lot of barbecue.

00:01:01.805 --> 00:01:04.249
My mom owned a few barbecue restaurants.

00:01:04.249 --> 00:01:06.490
I feel like, the way that I know it,

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:08.553
and soul food, the way that I know it,

00:01:08.553 --> 00:01:10.368
are both American cuisines.

00:01:10.368 --> 00:01:12.727
All I could connect to was America

00:01:12.727 --> 00:01:14.220
and American cuisines, specifically.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.686
So, it was really important
for me to get a deeper

00:01:17.686 --> 00:01:18.853
sense of self.

00:01:19.817 --> 00:01:22.055
Now we are going to make a mojo sauce.

00:01:22.055 --> 00:01:25.512
Mojo sauce has red
peppers, habanero pepper.

00:01:25.512 --> 00:01:27.515
And it has the coolest name ever!

00:01:27.515 --> 00:01:28.932
Mojo sauce...yes!

00:01:29.408 --> 00:01:30.561
I like a little bit of a kick,

00:01:30.561 --> 00:01:32.188
a little bit of a spice in my food.

00:01:32.188 --> 00:01:34.190
When you add a habanero, it gives it

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:37.205
just a tiny bit of a
kick, but nothing major.

00:01:37.205 --> 00:01:38.865
If you don't like any spice at all,

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.959
feel free to leave out
the habanero entirely.

00:01:40.959 --> 00:01:42.860
Now that I have my DNA results,

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:45.369
I'm really happy to
share it with my family.

00:01:45.369 --> 00:01:47.214
Share this meal with my family.

00:01:47.214 --> 00:01:48.593
See what they think of it.

00:01:48.593 --> 00:01:49.872
I think they're going to love it.

00:01:49.872 --> 00:01:51.221
My mom would be so proud of me for

00:01:51.221 --> 00:01:52.541
making this on my own.

00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:54.446
I encourage everyone out
there to do the same.

00:01:54.446 --> 00:01:56.775
This has been such a
cool experience for me.

00:01:56.775 --> 00:01:58.653
Now that I've made this dish,

00:01:58.653 --> 00:02:00.740
I can move on to the
rest of my DNA results.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:03.573
I have so much more to
explore, and I can't wait.

00:02:03.573 --> 00:02:06.240
(playful music)

00:02:07.841 --> 00:02:10.091
Oh my god! This is so good.

00:02:10.799 --> 00:02:13.549
(playful music)

